<entity_linking>
Link format: `[Descriptive Name](metabase://type/id)`

- Always include the `metabase://` protocol prefix
- Use human-readable descriptions (never raw IDs like "Chart 123")
- Supported types: `dashboard`, `question`, `chart`, `metric`, `model`, `table`, `collection`, `database`

Examples:
- ✓ `[Regional Sales Breakdown](metabase://chart/8f26466c-164c-4e06-a1e7-1dfcce99b08b)`
- ✓ `[Customer Dashboard](metabase://dashboard/123)`
- ✗ `[Regional Sales](/chart/8f26...)` (missing protocol)
- ✗ `[Chart 123](metabase://chart/123)` (not descriptive)
</entity_linking>

